"The operation to recover the spellblades is tomorrow.",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			{
"We've finalized the details; all that's left is to wait until the time is right.",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			{
"After I finish my work for the day, we sneak into the Republican occupation zone.",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			{
"Our goal is to look for a secret passage leading into the Imperial Palace.",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Ugh... kuh...”",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			{
"I try to pry open a rusted door with the crowbar I brought with me.",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			{
"The other side must be welded shut. My crowbar will break first at this rate.",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Looks like it's blocked for good.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okonogi sure isn't leaving any openings.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			{
"We've checked about a dozen different places based on\nAkari's memory, but every last one of them is unusable now.",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's about time for the next guard patrol. Let's go.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			{
"Akari grits her teeth, but I usher her back to the shop van.",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“All duds, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“At least we can confirm that your memory is reliable.”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But there's no point if we still can't get in.”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, man. All we needed was one, and we could've snuck into the palace.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			{
"She slumps back hard into her seat.",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			{
"This causes the hem of her skirt to flip upwards.",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Check your skirt.”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ahhh?!”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's no need to point it out like that!”",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			{
"She smooths it out in a panic.",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Would you prefer if I didn't mention it?”",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's not the problem...”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Jeez, forget it. If you still don't get it at this point, I'll just have to live with it.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			{
"She lets out a deep sigh and leans her face against the window.",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			{
"Akari suddenly turns forward.",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			{
"A convoy of military vehicles is cutting across the wide street of the Republican occupation.",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			{
"They're transports, with their cargo beds covered by thick armor plating.",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			{
"Our intel states that the spellblades will be transported midday tomorrow.",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			{
"This is surely unrelated, but just in case...",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm starting the engine.”",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"The five vehicles leave the Republican occupation zone and make their way into the city.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"I tail them from a distance to avoid arousing any suspicion.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Why are we going after those army vehicles?”",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I really like military hardware.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ever consider learning how to tell a proper joke?”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			{
"My phone rings.",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Soujin, what's your status?”",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			{
"A tense voice comes from my earpiece.",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the shop's van, on the move.”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I just got word from Koyuzu. The transport operation got moved to tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Apparently they're already underway.”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I think the convoy's right in front of me.”",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Huh!?”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'll keep tailing them. Any changes to the plan?”",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Negative. I'll round up as many people as I can, so keep following them.”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“On it. I'll contact you if anything comes up.”",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			{
"I hang up and focus on the road.",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So you ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"were",
{"/font"},
" tailing them. Sworn Blades work?”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, but you'll need to get off. It's dangerous.”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If that's the case, I definitely can't let you do this alone.”",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're injured. You'll only slow me down.”",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			{
"I immediately stomp on the brakes.",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			{
"We don't have time to argue about this.",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, eyes on the road!”",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"The transports suddenly pick up speed.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"I can't afford to lose them, so I start accelerating as well.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm pulling over at the next red light. Do as I say and get out.”",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'll stay out of your way.”",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm telling you it's dangerous!”",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"I want nothing more than to let Akari off, but now of all times, I manage to have extraordinary luck with the traffic lights.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"The transports surge forward relentlessly, leaving me no chances to pull over.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fine, you win.”",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't have to get out anymore?”",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just promise me one thing: You are ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"not",
{"/font"},
" getting out of this car during the operation.”",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't worry. I'll be good.”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			{
"She answers with a bright smile.",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"Are we really going to be okay?",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We intend to attack those transports. Our targets are the spellblades in their cargo beds.”",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, I see. The Sworn Blades need those.”",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But it seems like the Republic's sleeping on the job. I can't believe they're moving them in the open like this.”",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We've considered the possibility of a trap.”",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But our situation means we still have to seize this opportunity.”",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"Spellblades are in short supply within the Sworn Blades.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Even if this is a trap, we can't afford to let this chance slip by.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So, what's the plan?”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll first scrap the lead vehicle to stop the convoy. Then\nwe'll take out the one in the back.”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Finally, we neutralize the enemy and retrieve the goods.\nThat's all.”",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"I hear a voice from my earphones.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Operation is a go. Commence the attack at Point Bravo.”",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“The lead vehicle's mine. Soujin, you take care of the rear.”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Copy that.”",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"I say no more than necessary and cut off the comms.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Get my sidearm from the compartment.”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"Akari fishes through the compartment with a tense look on her face.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"Finally, she finds the short blade.",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"It's a spellblade I keep with me in case of emergency.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Be careful, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah.”",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The kill zone is a one-lane road located near Yogarasu District.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"Both flanks are restricted by densely packed buildings, leaving no room for any vehicles to escape.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			{
"There are few streetlights, and on a cloudy night like this, the street is shrouded in darkness.",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"I stare at the taillights of the vehicle ahead of me.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"Three hundred meters to the ambush point.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"Two hundred meters.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"One hundred.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"Fifty.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"I glimpse Hotori's figure cutting through the darkness like a shooting star.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"The spellblade in her hand draws an arc of dim light.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Teeeiiii!”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			{
"A flash─",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			{
"The lead truck in the convoy is rent asunder.",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			{
"The rest of the vehicles pile up into the first, one after another.",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"The road is completely blocked.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			{
"I pull over and get out, blade in hand.",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			{
"My mission is to destroy the rearmost vehicle and cut off any line of retreat.",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"Just when I start running─",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			{
"The transport's wheels let out a high-pitched screech.",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(It's reversing?!)”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"A mass of steel suddenly closes in on me.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"The red glare of its taillights fills my vision.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin?!”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			{
"The vehicle careens off the road and tumbles over, its right wheels missing.",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			{
"I'd cut its wheels off as it passed by me.",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"The man in the front seat kicks the windshield out and tumbles onto the road.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Before we even make eye contact, he's already reaching for the gun on his hip.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"He's clearly well trained.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"But in the time it takes the soldier to draw his gun, I've already circled behind him.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"I strike him on the back of the head with the hilt of my blade.",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Letting out a small groan, he collapses on the ground.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"Bullets may be fast, but their shooters are slow.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"When facing someone armed with a gun, the number one priority is to stay out of their field of vision.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			{
"...",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I look ahead to find Hotori knocking out an enemy soldier.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Is it over?)”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“(Yeah.)”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"I can tell from the movements of her eyes that she's neutralized the last of the enemies.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			{
"Our five allies seem uninjured, as well.",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			{
"The first phase of the operation was a success.",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			{
"All that's left is to retrieve the spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Tokita-san!”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“We can't open up this cargo bed.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			{
"Being an armored truck for transporting valuable goods, its cargo bed is practically a solid mass of steel.",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“I tried to cut it open, but I couldn't...”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Allow me.”",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"The armor is split open before she even finishes her sentence.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			{
"Hotori cut it herself.",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"The clean cross-section, without the slightest imperfection, speaks to her skills.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“A splendid display, Hotori-sama!”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“You'd better keep up your training, Koyuzu.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			{
"Hotori pats Koyuzu gently on the back.",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Let's make haste. We need to get moving.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, ma'am.”",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"I approach the rearmost vehicle to secure its cargo of spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"─Hmm?",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			{
"I hear the telltale signs of a person hidden inside the cargo bed.",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			{
"An ambush?",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"I send the entire armored canopy of the vehicle flying.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Wahyaaaaa?!”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Please don't kill me, please don't kill me, please don't kill me!”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“I am but a humble priestess! I would not harm a fly! I swear on Oomikami that I don't taste good!”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"The girl prostrates herself at extraordinary speed.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You're a priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, my name is Shiinoha Kotone! I serve as the Exalt-Priestess!”",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The Exalt?”",
			},
		},
		[160]={
			{
"I can't believe my ears.",
			},
		},
		[161]={
			{
"I look the girl up and down one more time.",
			},
		},
		[162]={
			{
"A vaguely cherubic countenance stares back at me.",
			},
		},
		[163]={
			{
"Her large, round eyes sparkle with guileless innocence, brimming with a curiosity vaguely evocative of small woodland creatures.",
			},
		},
		[164]={
			{
"Indeed, her vestments are of far higher quality than the garments worn by ordinary priestesses.",
			},
		},
		[165]={
			{
"She has an impressively refined bearing and diction, and exudes an almost otherworldly aura of purity.",
			},
		},
		[166]={
			{
"Perhaps she doesn't move about very much, though, as the arms peeking out from under her clothes look plump and soft.",
			},
		},
		[167]={
			{
"The large swell of her chest makes itself prominent even through her clothes.",
			},
		},
		[168]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What in the world is the Exalt-Priestess doing in a Republican Army vehicle?”",
			},
		},
		[169]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was asked to Hone some damaged spellblades.”",
			},
		},
		[170]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“When I politely refused, I was thrown into the back of this truck.”",
			},
		},
		[171]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How barbaric. What were the Palatine Guards doing?”",
			},
		},
		[172]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Th-They said they couldn't go against the Republican Army.”",
			},
		},
		[173]={
			{
"The Imperial Temple is the cornerstone of the Tento faith.",
			},
		},
		[174]={
			{
"How awful that even its guards are at the mercy of the\nRepublic's whims.",
			},
		},
		[175]={
			{
"Come to think of it...",
			},
		},
		[176]={
			{
"Didn't the student council president express some interest in the Exalt-Priestess the other day?",
			},
		},
		[177]={
			{
"Perhaps this was her handiwork.",
			},
		},
		[178]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Eminence, I trust that there is no falsity in your words?”",
			},
		},
		[179]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But of course, sir!”",
			},
		},
		[180]={
			{
"She bows once more for good measure.",
			},
		},
		[181]={
			{
"Despite her somewhat childlike cheeks being sullied with grime and sweat, she appears even younger than Akari.",
			},
		},
		[182]={
			{
"Either way, it doesn't look like she's lying, and we haven't the time to argue anyway.",
			},
		},
		[183]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well. I shall believe you.”",
			},
		},
		[184]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You have a warrior at your service. There is nothing to fear.”",
			},
		},
		[185]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh? A warrior, you say?”",
			},
		},
		[186]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Remaining here would be dangerous. This way, if you please.”",
			},
		},
		[187]={
			{
"I reach out and take the priestess by the hand.",
			},
		},
		[188]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah!”",
			},
		},
		[189]={
			{
"Just as my hand brushes against hers, a light shock courses through it.",
			},
		},
		[190]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Static electricity? My apologies.”",
			},
		},
		[191]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah, no...”",
			},
		},
		[192]={
			{
"She looks at me with astonishment on her face.",
			},
		},
		[193]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it?”",
			},
		},
		[194]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“P-Please, pay it no mind. I am fine!”",
			},
		},
		[195]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm glad to hear it.”",
			},
		},
		[196]={
			{
"I grasp the priestess's hand again.",
			},
		},
		[197]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah...”",
			},
		},
		[198]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What is it this time?”",
			},
		},
		[199]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“N-Nothing...”",
			},
		},
		[200]={
			{
"I escort her to the shop's van.",
			},
		},
		[201]={
			{
"The passenger-side door opens.",
			},
		},
		[202]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Kotone? It really is you, Kotone!”",
			},
		},
		[203]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Excuse me?”",
			},
		},
		[204]={
			{
"The priestess rubs her eyes.",
			},
		},
		[205]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“C-Could it be? Akari-sama!?”",
			},
		},
		[206]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you doing here of all places?”",
			},
		},
		[207]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Why in the world are you here in Tenkyo, Akari-sama?! Were you not residing in Iseya?”",
			},
		},
		[208]={
			{
"The two peer at each other's faces, each with eyes as wide as saucers.",
			},
		},
		[209]={
			{
"If she's an acquaintance of Akari, then the priestess must have been telling the truth.",
			},
		},
		[210]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you know each other, then I have nothing to worry about. Stay here for a while.”",
			},
		},
		[211]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, yeah. Get in here right away, Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[212]={
			{
"I make sure the priestess gets in the van before returning to secure the goods.",
			},
		},
		[213]={
			{
"Five minutes later, we're heading down a road far away from the scene.",
			},
		},
		[214]={
			{
"No casualties on our side.",
			},
		},
		[215]={
			{
"A cursory tally indicates that we recovered close to thirty spellblades.",
			},
		},
		[216]={
			{
"I leave the transportation of the spoils to Hotori and make for the Imperial Temple to escort the priestess home.",
			},
		},
		[217]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“U-Um, thank you kindly for rescuing me.”",
			},
		},
		[218]={
			{
"The priestess timidly calls out to me from the back seat.",
			},
		},
		[219]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It was the least I could do, Your Eminence.”",
			},
		},
		[220]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I would, however, ask that you do not speak of the events that transpired tonight.”",
			},
		},
		[221]={
			{
"I catch a glimpse of the priestess's nervous expression in the rearview mirror.",
			},
		},
		[222]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's possible that as early as tonight, Republican soldiers may come to inquire what happened.”",
			},
		},
		[223]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please pretend that you never saw us.”",
			},
		},
		[224]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“If you tell them you were thrown out of your vehicle during the accident and ran away without seeing anything, you should be fine.”",
			},
		},
		[225]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I understand. You have my word.”",
			},
		},
		[226]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Incidentally, sir, might I ask your name?”",
			},
		},
		[227]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Tokita Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[228]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[229]={
			{
"The priestess's eyes go wide in the rearview mirror.",
			},
		},
		[230]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“T-T-Tokita-sama? As in, ",
{"font", face="font/02.ttf", size=55, kerning=-3.5, hung=1},
"that",
{"/font"},
" Tokita-sama?!”",
			},
		},
		[231]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ohhhhh, such fortuity! What good fortune! Praise be to Oomikami!”",
			},
		},
		[232]={
			{
"The priestess thwacks the back of my seat in excitement.",
			},
		},
		[233]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It pleases me that you are so overjoyed, but am I mistaken in believing that we have not met before?”",
			},
		},
		[234]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, it was not I who made your acquaintance!”",
			},
		},
		[235]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Tokita-sama, are you acquainted with my prede... umm, that is to say, the previous Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[236]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“No, I'm afraid not.”",
			},
		},
		[237]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Huh?”",
			},
		},
		[238]={
			{
"This time, it's her mouth that goes wide.",
			},
		},
		[239]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But my predecessor regaled me with tales of you all the...”",
			},
		},
		[240]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You simply must know! You have to! You have to!”",
			},
		},
		[241]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Saying it three times isn't going to help.”",
			},
		},
		[242]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, perhaps...”",
			},
		},
		[243]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perhaps?!”",
			},
		},
		[244]={
			{
"She eagerly leans forward between the seats.",
			},
		},
		[245]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I lost my memories from before the war as a result of injuries I sustained.”",
			},
		},
		[246]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“So perhaps I really have met her, but I merely have no recollection.”",
			},
		},
		[247]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“B-But then... whatever am I to do...?”",
			},
		},
		[248]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Unfortunately, I'm as lost as you are.”",
			},
		},
		[249]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, just what did you do to the last Exalt-Priestess?”",
			},
		},
		[250]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Absolutely nothing untoward. Merely meeting her would have been a great honor.”",
			},
		},
		[251]={
			{
"I flatly answer Akari, who's smirking at me from the passenger seat.",
			},
		},
		[252]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What might your predecessor have said about me?”",
			},
		},
		[253]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I'm not privy to the details, but I am aware that you did a great many things for her.”",
			},
		},
		[254]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Oh, she never once mentioned anything bad, just to be clear.”",
			},
		},
		[255]={
			{
"Since time immemorial, warriors and priestesses have always had a close relationship.",
			},
		},
		[256]={
			{
"We call on the priestesses' services not just for maintaining our spellblades, but even in fine-tuning our own bodies.",
			},
		},
		[257]={
			{
"It would be no exaggeration to say that without the priestesses, warriors could only display a shadow of their full potential.",
			},
		},
		[258]={
			{
"On battlefields of yore, priestesses were even said to have fought alongside warriors.",
			},
		},
		[259]={
			{
"In general, the higher the warrior's status, the higher would be the station of their attending priestess.",
			},
		},
		[260]={
			{
"Considering House Tokita's stature, I find it hard to believe I could have ever had any contact with the Exalt-Priestess.",
			},
		},
		[261]={
			{
"Under what circumstances might we have met?",
			},
		},
		[262]={
			{
"Might Hotori know anything about this?",
			},
		},
		[263]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm afraid I cannot be of any assistance.”",
			},
		},
		[264]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ah... Is that so...?”",
			},
		},
		[265]={
			{
"The priestess flops back down onto the van's cargo bed.",
			},
		},
		[266]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Were you and your predecessor close, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[267]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She gave me considerable guidance.”",
			},
		},
		[268]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“She was a most kindly person, always willing to make time even for the likes of me...”",
			},
		},
		[269]={
			{
"The priestess's voice tapers off into a whisper.",
			},
		},
		[270]={
			{
"The previous Exalt-Priestess is said to have been killed in action during the war, but the details surrounding her death are still unknown.",
			},
		},
		[271]={
			{
"The general consensus is that she was caught up in the collapse of the Barrier.",
			},
		},
		[272]={
			{
"I glance out my window in the direction of the Imperial Palace. The shadow of a great boulder, riven in two, enters my view.",
			},
		},
		[273]={
			{
"That is the wreckage of the Barrier, the Artifact that defended us from invaders for two thousand years.",
			},
		},
		[274]={
			{
"I have no idea how it works, but countless priestesses have offered their prayers there since the dawn of the Empire.",
			},
		},
		[275]={
			{
"Needless to say, the collapse of the Barrier was one of the biggest reasons for our defeat.",
			},
		},
		[276]={
			{
"The Exalt-Priestess was undoubtedly involved, and I would absolutely want to learn the circumstances of her death.",
			},
		},
		[277]={
			{
"That said, it would be most improper to directly ask after the death of someone of such high station...",
			},
		},
		[278]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Your predecessor passed away during the war, is that right?”",
			},
		},
		[279]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Was she killed by the Republic?”",
			},
		},
		[280]={
			{
"I reflexively honk the horn.",
			},
		},
		[281]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Huh? What's wrong?”",
			},
		},
		[282]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Uh, a cat walked in front of us...”",
			},
		},
		[283]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, if you ever run over a cat, I'll never forgive you.”",
			},
		},
		[284]={
			{
"Her eyes shine with a genuine enmity.",
			},
		},
		[285]={
			{
"Never knew she was a cat lover.",
			},
		},
		[286]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Anyway, umm...”",
			},
		},
		[287]={
			{
"When Akari turns to face her, the priestess weakly shakes her head.",
			},
		},
		[288]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I, too, wish nothing more than to learn how my predecessor met her end.”",
			},
		},
		[289]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whatever might have happened during the war?”",
			},
		},
		[290]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Which is why, when I came to Tenkyo, I earnestly sought an audience with Tokita-sama.”",
			},
		},
		[291]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I had hoped... that he might have known anything at all.”",
			},
		},
		[292]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, that was why you were so shocked when you heard my name.”",
			},
		},
		[293]={
			{
"The priestess bobs her head up and down.",
			},
		},
		[294]={
			{
"The more I hear, the more guilty I feel for being unable to help.",
			},
		},
		[295]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Alas, my memory fails me...”",
			},
		},
		[296]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Perish the thought, Tokita-sama! You are not at fault.”",
			},
		},
		[297]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“But, um... if it pleases you, sir, might I inquire after you again in the future?”",
			},
		},
		[298]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Of course. There's always a chance I regain my memories, after all.”",
			},
		},
		[299]={
			{
"If I truly had any connection with the previous Exalt-Priestess, I'd also love to know the truth.",
			},
		},
		[300]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I am currently employed at a flower shop called Koujiya Flowers. Please feel free to stop by at any time.”",
			},
		},
		[301]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Koujiya Flowers... Thank you. I certainly shall.”",
			},
		},
		[302]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Incidentally, I train in the Imperial Temple's dojo on weekday mornings.”",
			},
		},
		[303]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We may run into each other on occasion. By all means, feel free to call out to me at any time.”",
			},
		},
		[304]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“You train at that dojo, sir?”",
			},
		},
		[305]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I was only ordained very recently, so I am afraid I must not have noticed.”",
			},
		},
		[306]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That is most understandable.”",
			},
		},
		[307]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“It's been a long while, Kotone, but I'm glad to see you're doing well.”",
			},
		},
		[308]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly!”",
			},
		},
		[309]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Um... might I inquire what you are doing in Tenkyo, Akari-sama?”",
			},
		},
		[310]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, not sure you'd believe me even if I told you.”",
			},
		},
		[311]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How do you two know each other?”",
			},
		},
		[312]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I made friends with her back in Iseya.”",
			},
		},
		[313]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Friends?! You truly consider the likes of me to be your friend?!”",
			},
		},
		[314]={
			{
"The priestess throws her arms around Akari, seat and all.",
			},
		},
		[315]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah, hey, lemme go!”",
			},
		},
		[316]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“What an honor this is! I thought you surely saw me as nothing more than a pebble by the roadside!”",
			},
		},
		[317]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I wouldn't normally be interested in talking to pebbles. Now let me go!”",
			},
		},
		[318]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“My humblest apologies, ma'am!”",
			},
		},
		[319]={
			{
"The priestess pulls back her arms in a panic, while Akari rubs her neck somewhat bashfully.",
			},
		},
		[320]={
			{
"It seems Akari is rather fond of the priestess herself.",
			},
		},
		[321]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“There's this academy for the priesthood in Iseya called the Imperial Seminary. Kotone was in training there.”",
			},
		},
		[322]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I happened to live near the academy, so she came to visit me sometimes. Isn't that right?”",
			},
		},
		[323]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“There wasn't a single person who hadn't heard of Akari-sama. We called her the Lord of Mount Momiji!”",
			},
		},
		[324]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's a rather dignified nickname.”",
			},
		},
		[325]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You're saying it doesn't suit me, right? Go ahead, laugh it up.”",
			},
		},
		[326]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Okay, okay, that's enough about me. Why don't you tell us what you've been up to, Kotone?”",
			},
		},
		[327]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“A few days ago, I was anointed as the Exalt-Priestess, and\nI've been assigned to the Imperial Temple to perform my duties.”",
			},
		},
		[328]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“That's amazing, isn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[329]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I never would've thought you'd become the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[330]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“It is a terribly great honor.”",
			},
		},
		[331]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Though even now, I still do not know why a novice such as myself was selected...”",
			},
		},
		[332]={
			{
"The priestess shrinks into herself.",
			},
		},
		[333]={
			{
"Seeing the Exalt-Priestess curling up into a ball in the back of a delivery van is a strange sight indeed.",
			},
		},
		[334]={
			{
"Well, come to think of it, the Imperial Princess is currently sitting in this very passenger seat, so perhaps it's not so strange after all.",
			},
		},
		[335]={
			{
"After confirming that we aren't being followed, I stop in a location close to the Imperial Temple.",
			},
		},
		[336]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Your Eminence, please proceed on foot from here.”",
			},
		},
		[337]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Thank you kindly for everything.”",
			},
		},
		[338]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“I shall absolutely repay you at a later date.”",
			},
		},
		[339]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Be careful around the Republican Army from now on.”",
			},
		},
		[340]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Yes, I certainly will. I shall be taking my leave now.”",
			},
		},
		[341]={
			{
"After bowing to us, the priestess tries to shut the door behind her.",
			},
		},
		[342]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Ugh. I-It's heavy...”",
			},
		},
		[343]={
			{
"The sliding door doesn't seem to want to budge.",
			},
		},
		[344]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Please wait one moment. There's a trick to it.”",
			},
		},
		[345]={
			{
"I step outside and help her.",
			},
		},
		[346]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Whoa, how strong you are, sir.”",
			},
		},
		[347]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's an old car, so it can be finicky at times. Now then, please take care.”",
			},
		},
		[348]={
			name={"name", name="Kotone"},
			{
"“Indeed, thank you very much once again.”",
			},
		},
		[349]={
			{
"With one last bow, the priestess heads off.",
			},
		},
		[350]={
			{
"After a short distance, she turns around and gives us a cheerful wave.",
			},
		},
		[351]={
			{
"What a merry person she is.",
			},
		},
		[352]={
			{
"When I step back into the front seat, Akari greets me with a cold glare.",
			},
		},
		[353]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You suuure were being awfully nice to Kotone.”",
			},
		},
		[354]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“As though I could just be rude with a priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[355]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But you can with a princess?”",
			},
		},
		[356]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“The only princess I know of is the type who tries to assassinate the chancellor of her own country.”",
			},
		},
		[357]={
			{
"I say as I start the engine.",
			},
		},
		[358]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But from now on, I'll be on my best behavior with you.”",
			},
		},
		[359]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You don't have to bother at this point. I honestly kinda like this, in a way.”",
			},
		},
		[360]={
			{
"If that's the case, I wonder what she was so unhappy about.",
			},
		},
		[361]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Just to be sure, does Her Eminence know your true identity?”",
			},
		},
		[362]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Nope, haven't told her.”",
			},
		},
		[363]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“But they called you the Lord of Mount Momiji, right?\nDoesn't 'Lord' kind of imply─”",
			},
		},
		[364]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I think it's just 'cause I was the only one living on that mountain?”",
			},
		},
		[365]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“She honestly looked pretty scared the first time she came by my house.”",
			},
		},
		[366]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'd bet her friends at the seminary got her to go check in on me. Like some sorta dare.”",
			},
		},
		[367]={
			{
"The slightest bit of self-reproach colors Akari's smile.",
			},
		},
		[368]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It would've made things so much easier if she could prove your lineage.”",
			},
		},
		[369]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“There's a good chance the warriors would believe the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[370]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“So they won't even believe the real deal, but they'll go and believe the Exalt-Priestess? What kind of sick joke is that?”",
			},
		},
		[371]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I mean, I'm sure you're probably right... Just, ugh...”",
			},
		},
		[372]={
			{
"Akari looks up at the ceiling and lets out a deep sigh.",
			},
		},
		[373]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We should definitely win her over to our side.”",
			},
		},
		[374]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I don't like that way of putting it.”",
			},
		},
		[375]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, I get what you're saying, and I do think it's a good idea as well.”",
			},
		},
		[376]={
			{
"Akari sinks into thought.",
			},
		},
		[377]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But although I might be Kotone's friend, I don't know what she's thinking now that she's the Exalt-Priestess.”",
			},
		},
		[378]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“We'll have to tread carefully.”",
			},
		},
		[379]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Fortunately, she seems to have taken an interest in me, so\nI'll try to remain in contact with her.”",
			},
		},
		[380]={
			{
"We nod at each other.",
			},
		},
		[381]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Oh, right. I almost forgot.”",
			},
		},
		[382]={
			{
"Akari fixes her posture and turns to face me.",
			},
		},
		[383]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm really glad you came back from tonight's operation safe and sound.”",
			},
		},
		[384]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I thought you were a goner when that Republican truck started backing up.”",
			},
		},
		[385]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oh, you mean what happened with that transport.”",
			},
		},
		[386]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Should I have said it earlier?”",
			},
		},
		[387]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I really meant to say it right when you got back, but I missed my chance because Kotone showed up.”",
			},
		},
		[388]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Haha, you were worried about that, of all things?”",
			},
		},
		[389]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Well, excuuuse me for caring about that of all things.”",
			},
		},
		[390]={
			{
"She turns away in a huff.",
			},
		},
		[391]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Sorry, that wasn't what I meant.”",
			},
		},
		[392]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What I'm trying to say is I'm always happy to receive your gratitude, no matter where or when.”",
			},
		},
		[393]={
			{
"Akari gives me a blank stare like a pigeon who just met the business end of a peashooter.",
			},
		},
		[394]={
			{
"But she quickly turns towards the window to hide her face.",
			},
		},
		[395]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You really need to work on the way you phrase things...”",
			},
		},
		[396]={
			{
"Her tiny whisper disappears into the din of the rumbling vehicle.",
			},
		},
	},
	label={
	},
}
